  &lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="font-weight: 600; font-size: 1.1em; color: #000;"&gt;&lt;a href="https://javascriptweekly.com/link/191127/rss" title="preactjs.com" style=" color: #3366aa;    font-size: 1.05em;"&gt;Preact 11 Released&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt; — Six years after &lt;a href="https://javascriptweekly.com/link/191128/rss" style=" color: #3366aa;   "&gt;the road to Preact 11&lt;/a&gt; began, the latest version of the popular &lt;em&gt;"alternative to React with the same modern API"&lt;/em&gt; is here, with improved hydration, automatic ref forwarding, and an ESM-only package. The &lt;a href="https://javascriptweekly.com/link/191129/rss" style=" color: #3366aa;   "&gt;upgrade guide&lt;/a&gt; covers the changes.&lt;/p&gt;
  &lt;p&gt;The Preact Team &lt;/p&gt;
