&lt;table border=0 cellpadding=0 cellspacing=0 border=0 cellpadding=0 cellspacing=0&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style="font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.48em; padding: 0px 15px;"&gt;

  &lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="font-weight: 600; font-size: 1.1em; color: #000;"&gt;&lt;a href="https://javascriptweekly.com/link/191130/rss" title="nuxt.com" style=" color: #3366aa;    font-size: 1.05em;"&gt;Nuxt 4.6: A Big Step Towards a Server-Agnostic Nuxt&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt; — A meaty release for the full-stack Vue framework with a server layer that no longer ties you to Nitro (pure Vite server builds are now an experimental option), built-in sessions, Vue Vapor support, and a new CLI (&lt;a href="https://javascriptweekly.com/link/191131/rss" style=" color: #3366aa;   "&gt;Nuxt CLI 4.0&lt;/a&gt;).&lt;/p&gt;
  &lt;p&gt;Daniel Roe &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/table&gt;
&lt;table border=0 cellpadding=0 cellspacing=0 border=0 cellpadding=0 cellspacing=0&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style="font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.48em; padding: 0px 15px;"&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;IN BRIEF:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Prolific package maintainer &lt;a href="https://javascriptweekly.com/link/191132/rss" style=" color: #3366aa; font-weight: 500;   "&gt;Sindre Sorhus has disabled outside pull requests&lt;/a&gt; due to AI contribution spam, though he'll keep maintaining his projects. &lt;a href="https://javascriptweekly.com/link/191133/rss" style=" color: #3366aa; font-weight: 500;   "&gt;SWC also now restricts PRs&lt;/a&gt; to trusted contributors.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;📊 The &lt;a href="https://javascriptweekly.com/link/191134/rss" style=" color: #3366aa; font-weight: 500;   "&gt;JavaScript Framework Benchmark&lt;/a&gt; site has added &lt;a href="https://javascriptweekly.com/link/191135/rss" style=" color: #3366aa; font-weight: 500;   "&gt;results for Chrome 154&lt;/a&gt; covering 196(!) ways to implement an app, how each performs, and how large they are.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://javascriptweekly.com/link/191136/rss" style=" color: #3366aa; font-weight: 500;   "&gt;&lt;code&gt;npm stage publish&lt;/code&gt; can now create new packages&lt;/a&gt;, so automated workflows no longer need a manual first publish.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/table&gt;
&lt;table border=0 cellpadding=0 cellspacing=0 border=0 cellpadding=0 cellspacing=0&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style="font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.48em; padding: 0px 15px;"&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;RELEASES:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://javascriptweekly.com/link/191137/rss" style=" color: #3366aa; font-weight: 500;   "&gt;Remix 3.0&lt;/a&gt; – No official post yet, but the new stable release of the rebuilt full-stack framework, with no React required. The &lt;a href="https://javascriptweekly.com/link/191138/rss" style=" color: #3366aa; font-weight: 500;   "&gt;RC release post&lt;/a&gt; has more info, though.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://javascriptweekly.com/link/191139/rss" style=" color: #3366aa; font-weight: 500;   "&gt;Ink 8.0&lt;/a&gt; – The popular TUI renderer now requires React 19.3 and adds scroll offsets for building scrollable views, now common in coding agent UIs.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://javascriptweekly.com/link/191140/rss" style=" color: #3366aa; font-weight: 500;   "&gt;Inferno 10&lt;/a&gt; – React-like UI library built for raw rendering speed. Now shifts more work from runtime to its JSX compiler.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://javascriptweekly.com/link/191141/rss" style=" color: #3366aa; font-weight: 500;   "&gt;Qwik 2.0 RC&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="https://javascriptweekly.com/link/191142/rss" style=" color: #3366aa; font-weight: 500;   "&gt;pnpm 12.10&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="https://javascriptweekly.com/link/191143/rss" style=" color: #3366aa; font-weight: 500;   "&gt;Ember 7.3&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="https://javascriptweekly.com/link/191144/rss" style=" color: #3366aa; font-weight: 500;   "&gt;Video.js 10&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="https://javascriptweekly.com/link/191145/rss" style=" color: #3366aa; font-weight: 500;   "&gt;ESLint 10.12&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
