  &lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="font-weight: 600; font-size: 1.1em; color: #000;"&gt;&lt;a href="https://javascriptweekly.com/link/191146/rss" title="claude.dev" style=" color: #3366aa;    font-size: 1.05em;"&gt;Getting Started with Claude Code &lt;em&gt;Mods&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt; — Claude Code has just added support for &lt;a href="https://javascriptweekly.com/link/191147/rss" style=" color: #3366aa;   "&gt;Mods&lt;/a&gt;, a way to extend the agentic coding harness with JavaScript so you can watch events, change behavior, and draw custom UI. Addy builds a mod here in ~80 lines that shows a live 'forecast' of your context window.&lt;/p&gt;
