&lt;p&gt;📄 &lt;a href="https://javascriptweekly.com/link/191156/rss" style=" color: #3366aa; font-weight: 500;   "&gt;How Booking.com Cut Its Node.js Service's Costs by 38%&lt;/a&gt; – By moving from PM2 to &lt;a href="https://javascriptweekly.com/link/191157/rss" style=" color: #3366aa; font-weight: 500;   "&gt;Watt&lt;/a&gt;'s worker threads and reworking load balancing and worker configuration. &lt;cite&gt;Ilya Malyavin&lt;/cite&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
