&lt;p&gt;📄 &lt;a href="https://javascriptweekly.com/link/191159/rss" style=" color: #3366aa; font-weight: 500;   "&gt;On Automatic Type Refinements&lt;/a&gt; – Which &lt;code&gt;filter&lt;/code&gt; callbacks let TypeScript narrow an array's type, and which don't. &lt;cite&gt;Radosław Miernik&lt;/cite&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
