  &lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/table&gt;
&lt;table border=0 cellpadding=0 cellspacing=0 border=0 cellpadding=0 cellspacing=0&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style="font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.48em; padding: 0px 15px;"&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Bring your wild ideas to &lt;a href="https://javascriptweekly.com/link/191175/rss" style=" color: #3366aa; font-weight: 500;   "&gt;Mozilla Festival&lt;/a&gt;. Gather and connect with other developers and creatives in Barcelona, Oct. 28-30. &lt;a href="https://javascriptweekly.com/link/191175/rss" style=" color: #3366aa; font-weight: 500;   "&gt;Get your badge&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://javascriptweekly.com/link/191176/rss" style=" color: #3366aa; font-weight: 500;   "&gt;Trigger.dev&lt;/a&gt; runs your TypeScript agents and workflows in production, with queues, retries, and no timeouts on long-running tasks.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/table&gt;
